18:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>a camel.Some render a cable; but it may justly be doubted whether [kamelos ] ever was so translated before, for the word for a cable, as the scholiast on Aristophanes expressly affirms, is written [kamilos,] not with an \"e\" [eta], but with an \"i\" [iota.] Some few MSS., it is true, have got the word [kamilos] into the text, but it is evidently an attempted improvement.</p>\n<p>Mt 23:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-18-26","title":"Luke 18:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>Who. 13:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-18-27","title":"Luke 18:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>1:37; Ge 18:14; Job 42:2; Jer 32:17; Da 4:35; Zec 8:6; Mt 19:26 Eph 1:19,20; 2:4-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-18-28","title":"Luke 18:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>5:11; Mt 4:19-22; 9:9; 19:27; Mr 10:28; Php 3:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-18-29","title":"Luke 18:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>There. 14:26-28; De 33:9; Mt 10:37-39; 19:28-30; Mr 10:29-31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-18-30","title":"Luke 18:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>manifold more. 12:31,32; Job 42:10; Ps 37:16; 63:4,5; 84:10-12; 119:72,103,111,127 Ps 119:162; Ro 6:21-23; 1Ti 4:8; 6:6; Heb 13:5,6; Re 2:10,17; 3:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-18-31","title":"Luke 18:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":31},"